{"id":"medicina","lemma":"medicina","pos":"noun","rank":1164,"glosses":["medicine"],"ipa":"/mediˈθina/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"medicinas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/65/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-medicina.wav","examples":[{"text":"La medicina sabe amarga.","en":"The medicine tastes bitter.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734432"},{"text":"Tengo que tomar medicinas.","en":"I have to take medicine.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/458997"},{"text":"Esta medicina podría curarlo.","en":"This medicine may cure him.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/733988"},{"text":"Escribe en este papel las medicinas que necesites.","en":"Write down the medications you need on this piece of paper.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1156122"},{"text":"Esta medicina sabe horrible.","en":"This medicine tastes awful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/531639"}]}